  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/attack-on-titan-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fattack-on-titan-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"website\"></a></p><h1>概述</h1><p>來自備受喜愛的動漫/漫畫《進擊的巨人》。享受一款全面翻新的 Minecraft GUI 體驗，包含令人難忘的調查兵團成員、巨人繼承者，以及主角兼反派艾連·葉卡。</p><h2>推薦模組包</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/shingeki-no-kyojin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>進擊的巨人 (Attack on Titan)</strong></a></li>\n</ul><h1>預覽 - 更多內容請查看展示區！</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qtWRQmit/images/43f739dd35e197bbf20a9ce34e0a759fe5750fe5.png\" alt=\"大型儲物箱選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qtWRQmit/images/744bc834596c10843a2757b662eda504df9a11ae.png\" alt=\"鐵砧選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/qtWRQmit/images/78b7185c018827f1ff8609a7e105371f317ee439.png\" alt=\"鍛造台選單\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p><h3>材質包備註</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是使用此材質包的 YouTuber 或內容創作者，請在敘述中附上此頁面的連結，以便他人知道你所使用的材質包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此材質包或任何修改版本，也包括轉載至其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我本人明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
